  "text": "### Mortgage Rates (Fixed vs. Variable)  \n**Fixed Rate Benefit:**\n- ✅ Rate guaranteed for 2–5 years\n- ✅ Monthly payment predictable\n- ✅ Protected if BoE raises rates  \n**Fixed Rate Risk:**\n- ⚠️ Early repayment penalties if you refinance\n- ⚠️ Rate re-fixes at end of term (may be higher)  \n**Variable Rate Benefit:**\n- ✅ Lower initial rate (usually)\n- ✅ No early repayment penalties\n- ✅ Benefit if BoE cuts rates  \n**Variable Rate Risk:**\n- ⚠️ Monthly payment unpredictable\n- ⚠️ Payment rises if BoE raises rates  \n---",
